      "y": 940,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "6 · RESOLUTION  🔮  (both lanes merge)\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nPOST /api/challenges/:id/resolve triggers the pipeline:\n\n  Final photo loaded from MongoDB (GridFS)  →  Gemini 2.5 Flash vision oracle judges it vs. success criteria\n  → XGBoost calibrates confidence  →  verdict: { met, confidence, reasoning, observedEvidence }\n  → High confidence? Auto-settles.  Low confidence? Manual override required.\n  → resolve_market on-chain (authority signs)  →  outcome written to MongoDB\n  → emitTicker broadcasts \"Market resolved YES/NO\" live\n\n(ResolutionPanel.tsx)  ·  If creator never posts proof → sweepResolutions cron → refundMarket",
